104
00:07:47,008 --> 00:07:50,008
One where your pesky pursuers can't reach you!

105
00:07:50,008 --> 00:07:53,008
I mean, I guess that's our only option, huh? I guess so.

106
00:07:53,008 --> 00:07:56,008
Oh well, guess we will do it.

107
00:07:56,008 --> 00:08:00,008
