122
00:08:51,008 --> 00:08:55,008
It's the glasses. That's how she knows. Oh, the glasses!

123
00:08:55,008 --> 00:09:01,008
Rule 1! Survive 2 laps with zombies on your tail!

124
00:09:01,008 --> 00:09:06,008
Zombies?! Where? Remember last year we beat up zombies?

125
00:09:06,008 --> 00:09:13,508
